(Based on a design experiment with playful approaches to teaching in soci\al education, )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(the article investigates teachers\222 and students\222 intercorporeal ex\changes and the )Tj
/C2_1 1 Tf
0 -1.412 Td
<>Tj
/TT0 1 Tf
0 -1.412 Td
(playful. The article provides examples and analyses of how these exchang\es may either )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(promote or prevent teaching situations from becoming meaningful and play\ful. The )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(article emphasizes the importance of developing didactic and pedagogical\ approaches )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(that take the intercorporeal dimensions of playful teaching into account\. Moreover, )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(it suggests that practicing patience in a concrete physical way might be\ a promising )Tj
0 -1.412 Td
(pedagogical approach.)Tj
